<title>USA: Gillette names exec VP of North Atlantic group.</title>
<headline>Gillette names exec VP of North Atlantic group.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gillette Co said Monday it has named Robert King executive vice president of the company's North Atlantic Group.</p>
<p>The North Atlantic group manufactures and markets Gillette's traditional shaving and personal-care products in North America and Western Europe.</p>
<p>Jorgen Wedel, currently president of the subsidiary, Oral-B Laboratories, has been named to replace King as executive vice president of the International Group.</p>
<p>The changes are effective February 1.</p>
</text>
